body:
@m4gr3d Sometimes back, I had tried this PR and didn’t run into any issues with the Android editor. But your WIP branch that adds the game tab using Services was crashing randomly in my tests.
I’ll again try this PR and do a code review soon.

By the way, are we sure about disabling Swappy? Just wondering if there’s a clear benefit to using Services that justify this change?

 > @syntaxerror247 is that caused by this PR or does it happen on `master` as well?

@m4gr3d I'm testing with editor build from this PR, so yeah by this PR. I can't reproduce it on master.

Might be better to rebase this PR to check if it solves the issue.
